  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "tags": ["technis", "observability"],
  "description": "Intel/AMD DRM and NVIDIA telemetry selected from the installed hardware. Missing hardware or unsupported counters show no samples. Intel engine utilization requires effective PERFMON capability.",
